# EXPECT: READS 'gx' on a path that can run before the module's own first write
#
# (#141 residual — THE CONTROL FOR THE ANALYSIS'S SHAPE, and an honest record
# of what the conservative choice costs.)
#
# `gx is 7` is the lexically FIRST mention of `gx` in the body, so the cheap
# test — "refuse only when the first mention is a read" — would accept this
# module. Iteration 0 still reads before any write, which is why the guard is
# a definite-assignment scan in which a loop body is never assigned on entry
# and an `if` counts only when BOTH arms assign.
#
# THE COST IS REAL AND MEASURED: on the parent commit this program MATCHES
# (VM `null / 7 / 0 / 42`, AOT the same — the VM's cleared loop env and the
# AOT's uninitialised C local agree on this instance, by two different
# mechanisms). It is refused anyway, exactly as the PROGRAM-scope member of
# this order class is (`outward_write_before_binding.eigs`, whose header also
# records that the VM runs it fine): an order the compiler cannot prove is
# refused rather than answered, and its sibling one file over
# (module_free_read_in_loop_body.eigs) diverges silently on the same arm.
#
# ONE stdlib module pays this: `ui_w_special` (`bnote`, written in five `elif`
# arms and read under a correlated `has_black == 1` guard) — the stdlib sweep
# goes 71 transpile / 6 refuse to 70 / 7. `ui_w_dialog` was the second until
# the nested-`define` arm learned to inherit the enclosing definite-assignment
# state (`file_dialog` binds `fd`, THEN defines the `_fd_on_select` callback
# that reads it — a body a closure can only enter after the `define` ran).
#
# The exit is MEASURED, not assumed: one `bnote is 0` before the `if wk == 0:`
# chain makes `import ui_w_special` transpile again (rc 1 -> rc 0). `local` is
# NOT the exit for this shape — `local gx is 7` inside the `if` here is refused
# by the module-shadow guard ("the shadow's C block scope would not cover every
# later use"), which is why the refusal names the definite-first-write exit
# first and qualifies the `local` one.
gx is 42
import _frbw_lexfirst
print of (_frbw_lexfirst.f of null)
print of gx
